bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXBKCuHaWibuhjsKRsO7MbBIIyU0UuH8xScg54UNF5taI3NDAa45fcnQAU86g7eJl1BcZUr3jkcog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于 Wuri 与 Gotiti\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Wuri与Gotiti是两个私有处理站，它们都位于埃塞南部部族州（SNNPR，单位类似于我们的省的概念)的盖迪奥（Gedeo，类比我国的县）区下属的盖德比（Gedeb，类比我们的乡一级单位）。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Gedeb与我们非常熟悉的“耶加雪菲”属于同级的行政单位，从属于Gedeo。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tt78AlV1Oout4VK9TgBp3u3wbiabXOgTvCBoIL11rMoglTeslboL6GBWQVQWEjHfAnUIgupbwMA9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Wuri本身是从属于更小的一级单位Worka Sakaro村，而Gotiti是位于同名的Banko Gotiti村下，就啰嗦到这，最后总结关系如下，\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia-SNNPR-Gedeo-Gedeb-Worka Sakaro-Wuri\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia-SNNPR-Gedeo-Gedeb-Banko Gotiti-Gotiti\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXBKCuHaWibuhjsKRsO7MbBoWTFHM0SOm12GSZILWUm71InSDN7ASFhmTiadicicFV37JxWhaPTDYPPg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           它们并不是位于耶加雪菲，为啥叫耶加雪菲呢？\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          市面上有不少咖啡其实并不是来自于耶加雪菲那个方圆几公里的小镇，而是来自于它的周边，像我们卖过的雪冽图，科契尔的Hartume这些，以前因为从种植/出口/销售的一些约定俗成的习惯大家就都用耶加雪菲来行销它，埃塞官方的商品交易中心ECX对于咖啡的行销是有明确的命名分类定义的（\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.ecx.com.et/Files/ECEA%20Coffee%20Rule%20Amendement%20Mar%2031%202022.pdf\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"链接\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           链接\n          </span>\n</a>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ），以咖啡的风味调性为主要参考，结合市场端的接受度反馈等，在最新的发布里我们看到耶加雪菲的下属范围以及那个涵盖了周边的大部分区域范围\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tt78AlV1Oout4VK9TgBp3uq1U5YCKicBjUJaqOS89m7KUfwdKP0ic0JjPrMo76ZH75Lm1T2G1GmOAQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n<strong>\n           为什么叫GG 0？\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n          这个批次是Royal Coffee\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n          202\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n          1开始新推出的一个生豆等级Grade 0， 是在Grade 1的基础上再做瑕疵和颗粒的筛选，得到更为精致细腻的一款产品；\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n          今年是我们第二年采购这个产品，今年的Wuri偏橙子，焦糖；Gotiti就偏黄柠檬，茶感，一个圆润饱满甜，一个清新细腻茶。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们认为，他们两的风味非常的相似，于是就想了一个新花样，将他们干脆放一起，做一个产品，代号GG 0，代表GedeoGedeb 0， 0代表可能，虽然当下他两在我们手里还有一些没有找到状态的感觉，但我们会继续探索，去更好的呈现它们的美丽~。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡，请进入淘宝和小程序选购哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡豆文章请参阅公众号的文章板块\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n</div>",
